    {
      "text": "They can sort out your registered office and it takes a lot longer than you think.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 617.72,
      "end_time": 623.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So if you are seriously thinking about opening up, I would stop the wheels moving now because you got to do all sorts of note.",
