      "start_time": 635.09,
      "end_time": 636.01
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, like.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 636.01,
      "end_time": 636.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Especially because you're international.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 636.97,
      "end_time": 637.93
    },
    {
      "text": "But they walk you through it all and like the ID and setting up bank accounts can take upwards of more than four months.",
