      "start_time": 638.01,
      "end_time": 646.17
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 646.41,
      "end_time": 646.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well, I've done it in the us.",
